Hi there,

We urgently need three top notch developers to fix and build on an SE Linux
based project. A significant portion of work has already been done, so a
period of knowledge transfer will be provided. There are also some
additional features that need to be implemented. Altogether, it is a very
exciting challenge!

We will pay UK=C2=A3400 - UK=C2=A3500 per day, depending on experience, on =
client
approval. Since the client needs this project to be completed quickly, we
require a full time commitment. We will not dictate where or when you
should work. We will require any affiliations with the NSA to be fully
declared.

Successful completion of this project will likely lead to involvement in
our other projects. We have several equally "nerd sniping" challenges in
the pipeline, making this a great opportunity.

Due to the nature of the project, I am unfortunately unable to broadcast
any further details. If you are interested, know of someone that might be,
or even if you can think of anyone who could point me in the right
direction, then please email me directly at j@om.ni so that I can send you
some more information.

Thanks!

James

